            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Jimmy Assist 0.5.0 — A clearer view of your AI usage

- A focused overview puts ChatGPT and Claude session, weekly and Fable limits together at the standard panel size.
- Service detail screens reveal exact reset dates, additional models, coupons and connection management when needed.
- The Control Room uses consistent typography, aligned settings, shared spacing, readable light/dark palettes and clear grouping across every tab.
- Large-text option, descriptive accessibility labels and keyboard shortcuts: Command-R refresh, Command-comma settings and Escape back.
- Stale and low-quota states use text/icons as well as color. Exit is grouped separately in More to reduce accidental clicks.
- Small displays retain a bounded panel with internal scrolling. Existing connections, refresh preferences, coupon confirmation and notification behavior are preserved.

Validated with native UI screenshots in dark/light mode, a 320-by-440-point preview, large text, service details, all settings tabs and keyboard navigation. The 115 core and 33 isolated RPC checks still pass. No real coupons were consumed.
]]></description>
