        <item>
            <title>0.4.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 00:45:23 +0900</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>40</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Jimmy Assist 0.4.0 — AI Fuel Gauge

UsageBar has a new face: Jimmy Assist, your AI fuel gauge. Existing accounts, preferences and signed online updates are preserved.

- Claude Fable's actual model-specific weekly quota, progress bar and reset time now appear. Current and legacy usage responses are supported without duplicating limits.
- Codex reset coupon count and earliest expiry are shown. Redemption requires an explicit confirmation. Uncertain requests keep the same saved request ID across restarts to prevent duplicate consumption.
- Settings are now a distinct Control Room with General, Notifications, Connections and Updates tabs.
- Pause/resume automatic refresh, network-aware polling, sleep/wake handling, bounded helper processes, WebKit timeouts and connection diagnostics.
- Diagnostic copying excludes account addresses and login credentials. No automatic coupon redemption or credit purchase.

Validation: 115 core checks and 33 isolated RPC checks, plus live quota/UI verification. Real coupons were not consumed during testing. Claude coupon redemption remains in Claude's official interface because a supported redemption API has not been established.
]]></description>
